# OpenEdx Koa LMS Architecture

**Stack**: OpenEdx Koa release · Tutor 11.1.0 · Django + Mako templates + SCSS

> **Maintenance rule**: Update this file whenever you add or remove Django apps, change URL routing, modify the template hierarchy, restructure SCSS, or touch theming/plugin configuration.

---

## Top-Level Repository Layout

| Directory | Role |
|---|---|
| `lms/` | Student-facing Learning Management System |
| `cms/` | Studio — course authoring tool |
| `openedx/` | Canonical new code (all new apps go here) |
| `common/` | Legacy shared code (being migrated to `openedx/`) |
| `themes/` | Comprehensive theme overrides (`red-theme`, `edx.org`, `open-edx`, etc.) |
| `requirements/` | Python dependency files |
| `setup.py` | Plugin/XBlock entry points |
| `webpack.*.config.js` | Frontend asset bundling |

---

## Key Django App Groups

### `lms/djangoapps/` — LMS-Specific Apps
- `branding/` — homepage view, footer API (`get_footer`)
- `courseware/` — course delivery, XBlock rendering
- `grades/` — grade computation and storage
- `certificates/` — certificate generation
- `discussion/` — discussion REST API
- `learner_dashboard/` — program/course list for students
- `mobile_api/` — mobile REST API
- `verify_student/` — ID verification

### `openedx/core/djangoapps/` — Core Shared Apps
- `theming/` — comprehensive theming engine
- `user_authn/` — login, registration, password reset
- `site_configuration/` — per-site config (`SiteConfiguration` model)
- `enrollments/` — enrollment REST API
- `content/course_overviews/` — cached `CourseOverview` model

### `common/djangoapps/` — Legacy Shared Apps
- `student/` — user registration, enrollment, roles, dashboard
- `edxmako/` — Mako template backend
- `course_modes/` — audit/verified/honor enrollment modes
- `third_party_auth/` — SAML/OAuth2 social login

### `common/lib/`
- `xmodule/` — core XBlock types (video, problem, html, sequence)
- `capa/` — CAPA problem engine

