## URL Routing

| File | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `lms/urls.py` | LMS root URL conf |
| `cms/urls.py` | Studio root URL conf |

Key LMS routes:
- `^$` → `lms.djangoapps.branding.views` (homepage / landing page)
- `^dashboard` → `common.djangoapps.student`
- `^courses/<key>/courseware/` → `courseware.views.index.CoursewareIndex`
- `^api/enrollment/v1/` → `openedx.core.djangoapps.enrollments.urls`
- `^oauth2/` → `openedx.core.djangoapps.oauth_dispatch.urls`
- Plugin URLs appended via `get_plugin_url_patterns(ProjectType.LMS)`

