## Settings Hierarchy

```
lms/envs/common.py       ← all defaults, INSTALLED_APPS, FEATURES, TEMPLATES
    └── lms/envs/production.py   ← production overrides (reads YAML env)
    └── lms/envs/devstack.py     ← local devstack overrides
```

Key settings:
- `ENABLE_COMPREHENSIVE_THEMING` — master on/off for theming
- `COMPREHENSIVE_THEME_DIRS` — list of paths containing theme directories
- `DEFAULT_SITE_THEME` — fallback theme when no `SiteTheme` is assigned

---

## Template Loading Order

1. `ThemeTemplateLoader` → `themes/<active-theme>/lms/templates/` (if themed)
2. `lms/templates/` — LMS Mako templates
3. `common/templates/` — shared Mako templates

**Key templates**:
- `lms/templates/main.html` — master layout; line 192 contains `<div class="content-wrapper main-container" id="content" dir=...>`
- `lms/templates/index.html` — landing page for unauthenticated users (body class `view-index`)
- `lms/templates/footer.html` — footer with org logo, innovation fond logo, OpenEdX logo
- `lms/templates/header.html` — site header

