## Plugin / Extension System (`setup.py`)

| Entry Point | Purpose |
|---|---|
| `lms.djangoapp` | Auto-install a Django app into the LMS |
| `cms.djangoapp` | Auto-install a Django app into Studio |
| `openedx.course_tab` | Register a custom course tab |
| `openedx.course_tool` | Register a course tool widget |
| `openedx.user_partition_scheme` | Register a user partition type |
| `openedx.block_structure_transformer` | Register a course block transformer |
